From: Stew Forster <stew675@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 6 Aug 2026 18:57:53 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 21/23] convert : fp8 delta-net gate projections (in_proj_a/b),
 pp512 6818 -> 7260

The two remaining BF16 GEMM weights in the delta-net path (in_proj_a/b,
[32, 2560]) are now F8_E4M3 via --fp8-delta-net-in-proj, so the 48 Cijk
launches per pp512 (~5.37 ms at ~112 us each) run on the fp8 wmma path
(~35 us each). pp512 +5-6%, tg64 -1% (decode alpha/beta now quantize+gemv),
PPL 6.2528 vs 6.2677 (within noise), generation matches.

Assisted-by: Claude
